        <artifactId>homing-doc-plus-demo</artifactId>
        <version>VOID-SNAPSHOT</version>
    </parent>

    <artifactId>homing-demo-components</artifactId>
    <description>
        The house's components in action, each in a small widget of its own: the component built
        live, its behaviour exercised and said, and every option it is controlled by - its axes,
        its type's - answered by the method the option names. The parties a demo meets its panels
        in: the one that controls it, keeping what is set across components, and the logs, one
        for what the demos did and one for what was set. A demo, not a library: never published.
    </description>

